  "start_node": "HERMIT_START",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "HERMIT_START",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "一位老者突然出现在你面前，他目光如炬，上下打量着你。\n\n\"你的剑骨体质倒是少见，可惜没人指点。\"",
      "next_node": "HERMIT_CHOICE"
    },
    {
      "id": "HERMIT_CHOICE",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "老者似乎在等你回应。他的气息深不可测，你不禁心生警惕。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "ask_learn",
          "text": "前辈所言极是，晚辈愿意受教",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "skill_give",
              "target": "sword_bone_insight",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "dao_heart_change",
              "value": 5
            }
          ],
          "next_node": "HERMIT_ASK"
        },
        {
          "id": "doubt",
          "text": "前辈是何人？为何要帮我？",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship_check",
              "target": "yunzhonghe",
              "operator": ">=",
              "value": 30
            }
          ],
          "next_node": "HERMIT_DOUBT_CHECK"
        },
        {
          "id": "refuse",
          "text": "多谢前辈好意，我想靠自己",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "dao_heart_change",
              "value": -5
            },
            {
              "type": "relationship_change",
              "target": "yunzhonghe",
              "value": -5
            }
          ],
          "next_node": "HERMIT_REFUSE"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HERMIT_ASK",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "老者微微点头，眼中闪过一丝赞赏。\n\n\"不错，有胆识。\"他伸出手指轻轻点在你的眉心。\n\n一股暖流涌入，你对剑骨体质的理解更加深刻了。\n\n[b]获得：[/b]\"剑骨洞察\"被动技能（修炼速度+10%）\n[b]道心：[/b]+5",
      "next_node": "END",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "skill_give",
          "target": "sword_bone_insight",
          "value": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "dao_heart_change",
          "value": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HERMIT_DOUBT_CHECK",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你警惕地看着老者，询问他的身份。",
      "next_node": "HERMIT_DOUBT_RESULT"
    },
    {
      "id": "HERMIT_DOUBT_RESULT",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "老者：\"哈哈，谨慎是好事。既然你与云中鹤那小子关系不错，我便多说一句——\"\n\n\"告诉他，故人还在等他。他自会明白。\"\n\n老者又指点了几句剑道，随即飘然离去。\n\n[b]获得：[/b]额外剑道指导",
      "next_node": "END",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "give_exp",
          "value": 15
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HERMIT_REFUSE",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "老者微微叹息：\"也罢，年轻人有年轻人的路。\n只是记住，剑道孤独，好自为之。\"\n\n老者摇头离开。云中鹤后来得知此事，表达了遗憾。\n\n[b]道心：[/b]-5\n[b]云中鹤关系：[/b]-5",
      "next_node": "END",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "dao_heart_change",
          "value": -5
        },
        {
          "type": "give_exp",
          "value": 5
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}